17. Find Gap Between Transactions

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import lag,datediff

w = Window.partitionBy("customer_id") \
          .orderBy("txn_date")

df.withColumn(
    "prev_date",
    lag("txn_date").over(w)
).withColumn(
    "days_gap",
    datediff("txn_date","prev_date")
)

SQL:

SELECT *,
DATEDIFF(
txn_date,
LAG(txn_date)
OVER(
PARTITION BY customer_id
ORDER BY txn_date
)
) days_gap
FROM transactions;
